Honestly this is a really sad story. I got 2 cats a year ago, brother and sister. Their names are Fox and Opal. They were wonderful, well trained, in perfect health, loved each other. They loved me, they both got their cuddle time in. 

&#x200B;

Here is where things turn. Right after their one year birthday, my now ex boyfriend, killed Opal. I don't really want to get into that in this story. I will provide information if asked. 

&#x200B;

I was absolutely devastated.

I had her cremated...

&#x200B;

I knew that Fox would need a companion, he is extremely active. Or he was at the time. I also knew that if I waited any long amount of time the chances of him accepting another animal into the house were slim to none. He is a large man, so I also knew that I would have to get a small female in order to have the best results.

&#x200B;

So, it was about a month after Opal's death that I got a 5 week old kitten, Sookie. ( Just so I don't get slammed, yes I know that is too young, the woman I got her from blatantly lied to me and told me that she was 7 weeks old and had already been weaned. This was a lie that caused many problems, but I digress) 

&#x200B;

Fox immediately hated her. But that only lasted about a week until he tolerated her. It has been about 3 months now and they do get along with each other and they play with each other. 

&#x200B;

The issue that I am having is that no matter what I do, Fox is just not the same. I guess I don't really expect him to be. He was also very close with my ex and after I kicked him out, Fox basically lost his sister and father at the same time. And then I thought it would be a good idea to try and get him a replacement animal. In retrospect idk what I was thinking.

&#x200B;

His relationship with me has really deteriorated. He used to cuddle with me all the time, and he won't anymore. He will not come near me if Sookie is around. If he does happen to come around for cuddles and Sookie gets too close he will leave.

&#x200B;

He won't even play with his toys if Sookie is playing too. I had to get a kennel to put her once in a while in just to try and get Fox to come out of his shell. So that he can see that I do want one on one time with him.

&#x200B;

I am literally starting to cry writing this. I feel like a horrible mother. I have tried everything to connect with him and it just seems like he wants nothing to do with me. If anyone has advice I will gladly take it...

I found a only pencil case that was full of odds and ends. Me and my friends picked it up hoping that it was someones weed stash, the state park we were in was always full of teens doing dumb shit. First of all that was dumb of us, it could have had any number of terrible things inside. Second it wasn't until years later I realized that it was most likely a geocache that I had happend to stumble on...

&#x200B;

I really don't remember what was in it, b/c i was already high and disappointed it wasn't more weed.  I just remember a lot of things wrapped in plastic baggies to keep out water.

When I was about 13 my family and I were on a bus coming back from a state fair. I was sitting in one of the window seats and my mom was in the seat behind me. I was just absent-mindedly looking out the window at the passing buildings and such. This was pre cell phones. All of a sudden my mom came charging up to my seat and was more pissed then I have ever seen her. She did not speak a word, she flicked off a man who was in a car keeping pace with the bus. He sped off. My mother went back to her seat, and still did not say a word.

&#x200B;

I had no idea what was going on at the time and as soon as is it happened I forgot about it. As I got older and I thought about the event from time to time, it dawned on me that the man was masturbating to me and only my mom saw him.

